# Deliberately conditional for one reload, to find out whether this client
# accepts the game-type token. kemayo's SilverDragon ships
# [AllowLoadGameType vanilla, tbc, wrath, cata, camelot] and is installed here,
# so the token exists; whether the file then loads is what /akforever answers.
